Modifications made by the ArabicFinBench authors, as required by Section 4(b)
of the Apache License 2.0:

  - Added an Arabic financial-document evaluation overlay under arabicfinbench/
    (canon/, concepts/, dimensions/arithmetic/, gt/, data/).
  - Added a Parse / Extract / Finance (P/E/F) reporting rule that keeps the
    three axes separate rather than reducing them to a single score.
  - Adjusted .gitignore so the overlay layout survives a fresh clone while
    source corpora remain untracked.
  - Modified src/extract_bench/inference/providers/ (registry.py and the
    parse/ and extract/ package initialisers) to record provider-module
    import failures and name them in the "no provider registered" error,
    instead of silently swallowing the cause.

